 href="/nba/story/_/id/50076974/jamal-shead-raptors-reach-3-year-24m-extension-2029-30" data-article-id="50076974" target="_blank"><img alt="Jamal Shead, Raptors reach 3-year, $24M extension through 2029-30" class="hsDdd NDJZt sJeUN IJwXl fIUJY PLAoQ XYehN " data-testid="prism-image" draggable="false" src="https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=/photo/2026/1001/r1724449_1296x729_16-9.jpg&amp;w=220"/><div class="VZTD JLLM rEPuv iFjMr "><h2 class="HQnBI SaBzo YoyA hmZPT GXlnk OMfUc GpQCA tuAKv OijMj PFoxV EgIWy kYhVs JeBeV pRDC ">Jamal Shead, Raptors reach 3-year, $24M extension through 2029-30</h2><div class="KCwhy kplNA GpQCA tuAKv OijMj PFoxV muyXk ">Raptors guard Jamal Shead has agreed to a three-year, $24 million contract extension with the franchise, his agent, KJ Smith, told ESPN.</div><div class="VZTD htRtm DTkhs WHJnO YwPRz mLASH iFjMr "><p class="YoyA hmZPT GXlnk OMfUc cKvru KCwhy kplNA ">8h</p></div></div></a><a class="zZygg UbGlr iFzkS qdXbA VZTD DbOXS tqUtK GpWVU iJYzE xuArw tfogu kkGSQ UcYFU lnSU " data-testid="prism-linkbase" href="/nba/story/_/id/50076885/cavs-donovan-mitchell-signs-new-multi-year-deal-adidas" data-article-id="50076885" target="_blank"><img alt="Cavs&#x27; Donovan Mitchell signs new multiyear deal with Adidas" class="hsDdd NDJZt sJeUN IJwXl fIUJY PLAoQ XYehN " data-testid="prism-image" draggable="false" src="https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=/photo/2026/0520/r1660765_600x400_3-2.jpg&amp;w=220"/><div class="VZTD JLLM rEPuv iFjMr "><h2 class="HQnBI SaBzo YoyA hmZPT GXlnk OMfUc GpQCA tuAKv OijMj PFoxV EgIWy kYhVs JeBeV pRDC ">Cavs&#x27; Donovan Mitchell signs new multiyear deal with Adidas</h2><div class="KCwhy kplNA GpQCA tuAKv OijMj PFoxV muyXk ">Cavaliers star Donovan Mitchell has signed a new multiyear contract extension with Adidas -- a deal that will take him through a 10th signature shoe with the same brand, becoming the seventh active NBA player to accomplish the feat.</div><div class="VZTD htRtm DTkhs WHJnO YwPRz mLASH iFjMr "><